This component is a negative-going detector for words that name an *aspect, dimension,
facet, field or area* of something ("another aspect of the ...", "在这方面", "一方面",
"dimensions", "in the area of"). It is silent on almost every token. It is strongest on
"aspect(s)" and its Chinese counterpart 方面 ("aspect, side"). It dips more weakly on
the other words of that family, and on the "of" right after "aspect". Its predictions are
negative, as the component's activation is.
