"""A tab-sensitive layout feature, rather than a general whitespace feature.

One tab in its own token gives the main positive response: larger after a
previous tab, smaller after a digit. Merged tab runs and tab-plus-space
padding have weaker responses. A lone nonbreaking space is also positive
when it continues a nonbreaking-space run. A textual backslash-t escape
and a tab followed by newline are weak positives. Ordinary text stays at
zero.
"""
