ASCII 7 gives a positive activation, larger at document start or after
an ASCII letter, and smaller after a period. Fixed estimates also cover
fullwidth ７, English seven/seventh and related stems, Chinese 七/第七,
Russian семь, Roman VII, and July. Other tokens get zero: the numerous
small, unrelated lexical effects are deliberately not reproduced.
