Short ath/math/bath/auth tokens receive large negative values; longer
relatives, path words, and selected mathematics, sports, bathing and
thoroughness words receive weaker values. A few Greek, Arabic and Chinese
forms are included. Ordinary tokens default to zero: this is not a general
mathematics-topic detector. LaTeX commands and numeric ordinal suffixes
have weaker responses. Small, unrelated lexical responses are omitted.
