"""Approximate familiar labels and structured-text continuations.

The most frequent strong training pattern was the assistant role in chat
headers. Other rules cover tool/reasoning boundaries, forum counters,
traceback labels, URLs, imports, filenames, and software-license clauses.
Unmatched tokens get zero: isolated lexical and proper-name responses are
not modeled. The 600-character context resets for every new document.
